SUMMARY:Smart Cities Saudi Expo
DESCRIPTION:The Smart Cities Saudi Expo takes place in Riyadh from 15–17 September 2026 at the Riyadh International Convention & Exhibition Center\, showcasing innovative technologies and solutions that support smarter\, more connected communities across the Kingdom. Co-located with the Global Infrastructure Expo\, the event brings together the full ecosystem of smart city technologies\, urban planning\, and digital infrastructure—offering visitors and industry professionals a prime opportunity to explore leading suppliers for smart city projects\, gain the latest insights\, and network with peers and decision-makers shaping the future of cognitive urban living in Saudi Arabia. Inquire Now
